<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="&quot;HARBOURFRONT DATA INFRASTRUCTURE LIMITED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited is a company involved in data center infrastructure projects. It has entered into agreements with Apex Builders (HK) Limited for the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project."&lt;SEP&gt;"Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited is an employer in a contract agreement for data centre fit-out and MEP upgrade works at Kowloon Bay Tech Centre, Hong Kong."&lt;SEP&gt;"Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited is identified as one party in the Main Contract, which forms the basis for the subcontract agreement with Apex Builders (HK) Limited."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 46}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 73}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APEX BUILDERS (HK) LIMITED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Apex Builders (HK) Limited entered into agreements with Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited for the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project, indicating a business relationship between these two organizations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Apex Builders (HK) Limited is the main contractor for the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project, responsible for overseeing subcontractors like Vanguard MEP Engineering (HK) Limited."&lt;SEP&gt;"Apex Builders (HK) Limited is the main contractor responsible for designing, supplying, installing, testing, and commissioning the Data Centre Fit-Out and Mechanical, Electrical &amp; Plumbing Upgrade Works at the Project Site."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 46}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 73}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TOWER B, KOWLOON BAY TECH CENTRE, 18 WANG TAI ROAD, KOWLOON, HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The project site is located in Tower B of Kowloon Bay Tech Centre on 18 Wang Tai Road, Kowloon, Hong Kong."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DATA CENTRE FIT-OUT AND MEP UPGRADE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROJECT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the main scope of works involving design, supply, installation, testing, and commissioning for a data centre fit-out and mechanical, electrical &amp; plumbing upgrade at the project site."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HONG KONG SPECIAL ADMINISTRATIVE REGION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Hong Kong Special Administrative Region (HKSAR&lt;SEP&gt;"The governing law is based on the laws of Hong Kong Special Administrative Region (HKSAR)."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;1 DECEMBER 2026&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is the commencement date for the works as per the contract agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;30 NOVEMBER 2027&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is the deadline for practical completion of all works, with MEP testing and commissioning to be completed no later than 15 July 2027 according to the contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HK$50,000 PER CALENDAR DAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This refers to the liquidated damages rate at which Apex Builders (HK) Limited will pay Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited if they fail to achieve practical completion by 30 November 2027."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAIN CONTRACT AGREEMENT FOR DATA CENTRE FIT-OUT &amp; MEP UPGRADE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"DOCUMENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This is the title of the main contract agreement document, which outlines the terms and conditions between Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited and Apex Builders (HK) Limited regarding data centre fit-out and MEP upgrade works."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HDIL-2026-MC-01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"HDIL-2026-MC-01 refers to the main contract between Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited and Apex Builders (HK) Limited, which is the basis for the subcontract agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a reference number for the main contract agreement document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7e1439fe1d96e82c71e1322be4ffbefc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAIN CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Main Contractor is a party involved in a contract agreement, responsible for achieving Practical Completion by 30 November 2027 and subject to paying Liquidated Damages if the deadline is not met."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Main Contractor is mentioned as a party in relation to the Subcontractor's rights but does not have veto power over the subcontracting of MEP installation works."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Main Contractor is the primary contractor who will receive payments from the Employer and has a strict pay-when-paid condition precedent to release funds to the Subcontractor for MEP Works."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Main Contractor is the primary entity in charge of major projects, retaining Performance Bonds from Subcontractor until specific conditions are met."&lt;SEP&gt;"The primary contractor responsible for completing works under the terms of the Contract, subject to various conditions including liability caps and delay penalties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cee928581076993e6dc7290419d468&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIQUIDATED DAMAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A predefined amount of HK$120,000 per working day for delay in achieving Practical Completion as specified by the contract date."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquidated Damages are financial penalties imposed on the Main Contractor if Practical Completion by 30 November 2027 is not achieved, at a rate of HK$50,000 per calendar day."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquidated Damages are pre-determined sums of money agreed upon in a contract as compensation for breach of terms, which can be deducted from payments made under the Contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e827172d85d4fce202f234f783e044</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT_A_MAIN_WORKS_AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contract_A_Main_Works_Agreement refers to the main works agreement document that outlines terms and conditions between the Employer and Main Contractor regarding payment, retention money, and other contractual obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Contract_A_Main_Works_Agreement is a legal document that outlines terms and conditions for services including dispute resolution methods such as arbitration administered by HKIAC."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is a reference to an agreement document that outlines the terms and conditions between the Employer, Main Contractor, and other parties involved in the Project Site."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad2a4a96d27752f49d1fe3251581e042</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 53}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRACTICAL COMPLETION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Practical Completion is a milestone in construction projects indicating that works have been completed to an extent sufficient for use, marking the start of warranty periods and other obligations."&lt;SEP&gt;"Practical Completion is a milestone in the project where all work has been completed as per the contract requirements, with no outstanding defects or issues."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HK$48,000,000 (HONG KONG DOLLARS FORTY-EIGHT MILLION ONLY)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This amount represents the fixed Lump Sum Contract Price agreed upon between the Employer and Main Contractor for the project."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 53}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RETENTION MONEY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Retention Money is a portion of each interim payment deducted by the Employer at 5% to secure performance, with a maximum limit of HK$1,500,000."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Payment Claim refers to the monthly submission by the Main Contractor for interim payments on the last day of each calendar month as per the agreement terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PAYMENT RESPONSE AND SETTLEMENT PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process involves the Employer's Engineer issuing a Payment Response within 45 days after receipt of a Payment Claim, followed by payment of the certified amount within 90 days from the date of the Payment Claim."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONDITIONAL SET-OFF&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Conditional Set-Off is an action where the Employer may withhold or deduct any sum from certified payments at its discretion without issuing a notice of intention to do so."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROHIBITION ON SUSPENSION AND ADJUDICATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"RULE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This rule prohibits the Main Contractor from suspending work, reducing progress rates, or initiating statutory adjudication proceedings due to non-payment or late payment by the Employer under any circumstances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHILLERS, UNINTERRUPTIBLE POWER SUPPLIES (UPS), AND HIGH-VOLTAGE SWITCHGEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific types of equipment that must be brand-new and manufactured in the European Union or Japan as per the quality standards outlined in the agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are types of equipment that must be brand-new and manufactured in the European Union or Japan as per quality standards outlined in agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-754aa01b6700b16ce9dfa955549688dc</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 23}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY SECURITY OF PAYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 652)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LAW"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Construction Industry Security of Payment Ordinance is a legal framework designed to protect contractors from non-payment or late payment by employers, providing security measures for construction industry workers."&lt;SEP&gt;"This refers to the legal framework governing payment conditions in construction industry contracts, which is overridden by the strict pay-when-paid condition precedent as per the subcontract agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 51}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHILLERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chillers are cooling equipment used in HVAC systems to provide chilled water for air conditioning or process cooling. They must be brand-new and manufactured in the European Union or Japan according to the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNINTERRUPTIBLE POWER SUPPLIES (UPS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Uninterruptible Power Supplies (UPS) are devices that provide backup power to critical equipment, ensuring continuous operation during a power failure. The agreement specifies they must be brand-new and manufactured in the European Union or Japan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIGH-VOLTAGE SWITCHGEAR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"High-Voltage Switchgear is electrical equipment used for switching and protecting high-voltage circuits. It must also comply with the quality standards set by the agreement, being brand-new and manufactured in the European Union or Japan."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PROJECT SITE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Project Site refers to the physical location where construction works are carried out under the main works agreement, subject to specific access rules and working hours restrictions."&lt;SEP&gt;"The location where work under this Contract takes place, subject to potential legal liabilities related to death or personal injury."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 52}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NIGHT SHIFTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Night Shifts refer to work activities between 18:00 and 08:00 on weekdays or any time outside of permitted working hours as defined by the Noise Control Ordinance, which are strictly prohibited according to the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 52}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DEFECTS LIABILITY PERIOD (DLP)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Defects Liability Period is a specific timeframe during which defects in workmanship and materials can be rectified. It lasts for 18 months from the Date of Practical Completion, covering all MEP systems installed under the main works agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Defects Liability Period is an event or period during which the Subcontractor has obligations to rectify defects in their work, lasting twelve months from Practical Completion of the Subcontract Works."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DATE OF PRACTICAL COMPLETION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Date of Practical Completion marks the end of a construction project when it is deemed ready for use and transfer to the employer. It triggers the start of the Defects Liability Period during which any defects must be addressed."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3b058c3b28ea06cde28836452c1e618</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 50}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYER LIABILITY CAP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Employer's total aggregate liability under or in connection with the Contract shall not exceed HK$100,000."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 52}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INDEMNITY FOR CRIMINAL PENALTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Main Contractor is required to fully indemnify and reimburse the Employer for any criminal fines or statutory penalties imposed by the Labour Department or any court under specific ordinances."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 52}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DELAY PENALTIES AND FORFEITURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"If the Main Contractor fails to achieve Practical Completion of the Works by 31 August 2027, Liquidated Damages at a rate of HK$120,000 per working day will be paid from 1 September 2027 until actual completion."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 54}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RESTRICTION ON SUB-SUBCONTRACTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Main Contractor may engage a domestic MEP subcontractor but must obtain prior written consent from the Employer to sub-sublet any part of the MEP Works to a tier-2 sub-subcontractor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DISPUTE RESOLUTION MECHANISM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Any disputes arising out of or in connection with this Contract shall be heard and determined by the courts of the Hong Kong Special Administrative Region, and parties irrevocably waive any right to refer such disputes to arbitration. Legal notices must be served only by registered post."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HKIAC ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mandatory arbitration through the Hong Kong International Arbitration Centre (HKIAC) is required to resolve any disputes not resolved under other clauses of the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HK$100,000 LIABILITY CAP&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A financial limit of HK$100,000 for Employer's liability under or in connection with this Contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DOMESTIC MEP SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A specific type of subcontractor that may be engaged by the Main Contractor, subject to Employer's prior written consent for further sub-subletting."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;OCCUPATIONAL SAFETY AND HEALTH ORDINANCE (CAP. 509)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An ordinance under which criminal fines or statutory penalties can be imposed by the Labour Department."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Occupational Safety and Health Ordinance is a legal framework designed for the protection of workers' health and safety, imposing penalties on violations."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 26}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 62}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;REGISTERED POST SERVICE OF PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The method by which legal notices must be served, as specified in the agreement document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXCLUSIVE COURT JURISDICTION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The courts of Hong Kong Special Administrative Region have exclusive jurisdiction over any disputes arising from this contract, and parties waive their right to arbitration."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TIER-2 SUB-SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Sub-subcontractors beyond the first tier, requiring prior written consent from the Employer for engagement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HKIAC (HONG KONG INTERNATIONAL ARBITRATION CENTRE)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An arbitration center where mandatory disputes must be resolved according to the contract's terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"HKIAC is a recognized arbitration center where disputes arising from the contract will be finally resolved according to their rules."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c0c8960d3af997dd63f6f6d7ffacd99c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ad2a4a96d27752f49d1fe3251581e042</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIAL ADMINISTRATIVE REGION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Special Administrative Region refers to an area with exclusive jurisdiction over certain legal matters as stated in the contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ad2a4a96d27752f49d1fe3251581e042</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SERVICE OF PROCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Service of Process refers to the method of delivering legal notices, which in this case can only be done via registered post according to the contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ad2a4a96d27752f49d1fe3251581e042</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 53}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MANDATORY HKIAC ARBITRATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Mandatory HKIAC Arbitration is a clause that mandates any disputes arising from the Contract_A_Main_Works_Agreement must be resolved through arbitration by the Hong Kong International Arbitration Centre, strictly barring court litigation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ad2a4a96d27752f49d1fe3251581e042</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 53}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PRICING AND PAYMENT SCHEDULE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT,TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Pricing and Payment Schedule details the total contract price and retention percentage as stipulated in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-ad2a4a96d27752f49d1fe3251581e042</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 15}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 53}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VANGUARD MEP ENGINEERING (HK) LIMITED&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vanguard MEP Engineering (HK) Limited is a subcontractor working on the MEP Works for the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project under the terms of Subcontract APEX-2026-SUB-MEP-01."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386</data>
