<node id="&quot;KOWLOON BAY DATA CENTRE PROJECT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project is a specific construction site where MEP works are being carried out under the terms of both the Main Contract and Subcontract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 46}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APEX-2026-SUB-MEP-01&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"APEX-2026-SUB-MEP-01 refers to the specific subcontract between Apex Builders (HK) Limited and Vanguard MEP Engineering (HK) Limited for the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 47}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEP WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MEP Works refer to Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing works which are a part of the construction project at the Kowloon Bay Data Centre."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 46}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NIGHT SHIFTS (22:00 TO 06:00)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Night shifts during specific hours are designated for certain MEP installation activities such as chiller rigging, ductwork installation, and high-voltage cable pulling to avoid daytime disruptions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 46}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 74}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Subcontractor refers to a company or organization that undertakes work under the supervision and control of the Main Contractor, responsible for defect rectification and providing performance bonds."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subcontractor has the unconditional right to sub-let 100% of the MEP installation works to third-party tier-2 sub-subcontractors without prior consent from, or notice to, the Main Contractor or Employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subcontractor is an organization responsible for executing MEP (Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing) works under specific conditions regarding payment and defect liability."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cee928581076993e6dc7290419d468</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Building Management refers to the entity responsible for managing and maintaining the building where MEP works are being performed, requiring coordination from the Subcontractor during daytime hours."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CHILLER RIGGING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Chiller Rigging is a specific technology or installation task that must be executed exclusively during Night Shifts (22:00 to 06:00) and on Sundays as per the subcontract agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DUCTWORK INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ductwork Installation refers to the product or service of installing duct systems, which is also a task that must be performed during Night Shifts (22:00 to 06:00) and on Sundays as per the subcontract agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIGH-VOLTAGE CABLE PULLING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"High-Voltage Cable Pulling is another specific technology or installation task that must be executed exclusively during Night Shifts (22:00 to 06:00) and on Sundays as per the subcontract agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LUMP SUM SUBCONTRACT PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATHEMATICS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Lump Sum Subcontract Price is a fixed amount of HK$19,800,000 for executing MEP works under this subcontract agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAIN CONTRACTOR'S ENTITLEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Main Contractor's Entitlement pertains to the Subcontractor's right to receive payments from the Main Contractor based on timely receipt of funds from the Employer, subject to a strict pay-when-paid condition precedent."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 8}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 51}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PERFORMANCE BOND&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 10% on-demand Performance Bond must be provided by the Subcontractor and will be released immediately upon expiry of the Defects Liability Period as per Clause 5.2 in the subcontract agreement."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Performance Bond is a financial guarantee provided by Subcontractor to ensure their obligations are met, which can be released after specific conditions are fulfilled."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Subcontract Works is the organization that enters into agreements with Main Contractor for subcontracted works, including obligations related to defect rectification and performance bonds."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;12-MONTH DLP UNDER CLAUSE 5.1&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The 12-month Defects Liability Period (DLP) mentioned in Clause 5.1 is an event during which Subcontractor must rectify defects, with obligations ceasing upon its expiry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 12}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;24-MONTH PERIOD FROM PRACTICAL COMPLETION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A 24-month warranty period starting from the date of practical completion where all MEP systems are warranted and any arising defects will be rectified by Subcontractor at their own cost."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LABOUR WAGES AND WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This section deals with labor management practices related to wages and compensation within the industry context."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIRECT LABOUR MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Direct Labour Management refers to a system or process where Subcontractor is solely responsible for managing site workers' wages and MPF contributions, indicating an internal organizational technology or procedure."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAIN CONTRACTOR STATUTORY LIABILITY EXEMPTION UNDER SECTION 43C OF THE EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 57)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event where Main Contractor is exempted from liability for unpaid wages of Subcontractor's employees, as per Cap. 57."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282) FOR WORK INJURIES SUSTAINED BY THE SUBCONTRACTOR'S WORKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event where Main Contractor is exempted from liability under Section 24 of Cap. 282, which covers compensation claims related to work-related injuries."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;7-DAY TIME-BAR FOR NOTICE OF VARIATION CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A strict time-bar requirement that Subcontractor must submit a written notice within seven calendar days after the occurrence of variation events, otherwise such claim will be invalid."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 58}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MEP INSTALLATION WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"MEP Installation Works refer to Mechanical, Electrical, and Plumbing construction tasks that can be subcontracted according to the terms outlined in the agreement."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-62cee928581076993e6dc7290419d468</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUB-SUBCONTRACTORS (TIER-2)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Tier-2 Sub-subcontractors are third-party entities authorized by the Subcontractor to perform specific parts of the MEP installation works without needing prior approval from the Main Contractor or Employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-62cee928581076993e6dc7290419d468</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Tender Opening Team is responsible for handling submitted tenders, including making copies when necessary and charging fees for duplicate documents in electronic format."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tender Opening Team is responsible for making copies of required documents in electronic format when tenderers fail to submit duplicates, as mentioned in clause (d)."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tender Opening Team is responsible for opening tenders and consists of members from the Tender Board."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e28ad3fe56bbc0f196e83b01855316a</data>
