  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Engineer/Surveyor/Supervising Officer is a designated official who will receive the tenderers' completed Reply Slips via fax or postal mail, which could be relevant to Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited as it may need to interact with this individual in their construction projects."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Engineer/Surveyor/Supervising Officer is a designated official who will receive the tenderers' completed Reply Slips via fax or postal mail."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
