  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This likely refers to a specific document or regulation related to construction or engineering projects, possibly within the building and civil works industry."&lt;SEP&gt;"WBTC No. 4/92 likely refers to a specific document or regulation related to construction or engineering projects, possibly within the building and civil works industry."</data>
