<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Government Secretariat Tender Box and Public Works Tender Box are locations where sealed tenders should be delivered after being checked for completeness."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are specific locations where tender documents can be deposited before the closing time of a tender process, which could impact Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited as it is involved in construction projects."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are specific locations where tender documents can be deposited before the closing time of a tender process."&lt;SEP&gt;"These are the locations specified for tender submissions, each having its own set of rules regarding delivery times and conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
