  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Central Tender Board and Public Works Tender Board are organizations responsible for making copies of Bills of Quantities and Schedule of Proportions, and levying charges for such services."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Central Tender Board and Public Works Tender Board manage the process of tender submission, including handling delays due to tropical cyclones or extreme weather conditions."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
