  <data key="d1">"These individuals or roles are periodically advised to levy charges for additional tender submissions as duplicates in various formats."&lt;SEP&gt;"These individuals or roles oversee financial matters related to tenders and may advise on charges for copying documents."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
