  <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Tender Box is a physical location where tenders are deposited, with specific guidelines for submission times and formats."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tender Box is a secure location for depositing tenders, used by the Government in public works projects."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
