  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Blockages at these locations during the tender closing period can lead to extensions in the deadline for submissions if they occur between 9 a.m. and noon on the closing date."&lt;SEP&gt;"These locations can experience blockages during tender closing periods, which could affect Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited as it is involved in construction projects and may need to submit tenders through these locations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
