  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These weather-related events can extend the tender submission period and are relevant to Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited as it is involved in construction projects."&lt;SEP&gt;"These weather-related events can extend the tender submission period, provided they are in effect during specific hours of the day on the closing date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 7}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 46}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 75}]</data>
