  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Announcements regarding extreme conditions after super typhoons may also lead to extensions in the tender submission deadline if issued within a certain time frame before noon on the closing date."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;</data>
