<node id="&quot;GOVERNMENT OF HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Government of Hong Kong is a governing body that oversees and enforces laws, including those related to contracts for building works."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 67}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE SURVEYOR'S REPRESENTATIVE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Maintenance Surveyor’s Representative is a person designated by the Maintenance Surveyor to perform specific duties under Clause 2(2) of the contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"A representative of the Maintenance Surveyor who may provide instructions or decisions related to work execution and claim handling."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is an authorized individual who maintains Site Diaries, records daily activities, and ensures proper documentation as per the Maintenance Surveyor’s instructions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is an individual authorized to watch, inspect works, test materials, examine workmanship, and carry out other delegated duties from the Maintenance Surveyor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Maintenance Surveyor's Representative maintains site diaries for specific Works and records daily information related to labor, plant, materials, utilities, work carried out, and instructions issued to the Contractor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is a person authorized by the Maintenance Surveyor to give directions and instructions, acting on behalf of the Maintenance Surveyor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is a person authorized to act on behalf of the Maintenance Surveyor in overseeing the quality of workmanship and materials as required by the Contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is a role authorized by the Maintenance Surveyor, having similar powers of inspection and approval as the main Maintenance Surveyor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is an individual who prescribes forms for labor returns and provides orders regarding the disposal of discovered articles."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative is someone delegated by the Maintenance Surveyor to perform certain duties, whose actions within specified terms are binding on the Contractor and Employer."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Maintenance Surveyor's Representative signs the Complaint Chit to acceptably carry out work within 12 working days of issue."&lt;SEP&gt;"The representative is responsible for approving quotations and signing lists and statements submitted by the Contractor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The representative of a Maintenance Surveyor has similar duties and powers in managing the maintenance survey for building works under contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-a5353a0b04268f3f2bf8419dceec4f2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b303be3f296ee1a255a0d6e39708e058&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-949aa5f14dfe77c1d4658936c3d545de&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77cf568578b8488d566bb45f92f61c0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0c5e3d59d6713fc43836ebeb09b59a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abfa4c447132cda1acca49de3797a9c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a3e48c641bb7544fa8f59eeacc0c3c2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8ac9b93ec382ad9a1bb20e1b7960a03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d6fcfdf9559a5ecd190189bd2dc1bf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-49aef112fabf90ecd0181146a7452f1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e32963fd7d32ec116c9715aae3cbcb4c</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 6}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 43}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 69}]</data>
</node>
