  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An event where one party transfers their rights or obligations to another, as detailed in Clause 3 of the General Conditions of Contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBLETTING&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of a contractor subleasing part of the contracted work to others, regulated by Clauses 4 and 5 of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Contract Documents encompass all mutually explanatory documents forming part of the Contract and include General Conditions, Special Conditions, Drawings, Specifications, etc., providing comprehensive guidelines for project execution."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contract Documents include all information provided for contracts such as Drawings or other documents required by Clause 7, which must be in English according to Clause 9."&lt;SEP&gt;"Contract documents include drawings, other Contract materials provided by both parties for executing work under the contract. They are used to ensure compliance with contractual terms and conditions."&lt;SEP&gt;"Documents that are mutually explanatory and provide necessary information for executing building works as outlined in Clause 6 onwards."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0764b1a02432b62a0ad22895f699b3d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb1308c02d44b7ab0dcb7b386e3c410&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-599efa27c5ee543ca385bb3d944e13fe</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DRAWINGS PROVIDED BY THE CONTRACTOR FOR THE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Technical drawings prepared by contractors to guide construction work, mentioned in Clause 7 of the document."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 13}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACTOR'S EMPLOYEES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
