</node>
<node id="&quot;SETTING-OUT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Setting-out involves the precise positioning of construction elements based on reference points provided by the Maintenance Surveyor, ensuring correct dimensions and alignment throughout the project."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of marking out or laying down a construction site as per Clause 21 of the General Conditions of Contract."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0c2ce37d3bd5b0e583c4fe6bb69ef68b</data>
