  <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Ensuring safety measures are in place to protect both persons and property during construction, discussed under Clause 22."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 17}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 57}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAMAGE TO PERSONS AND PROPERTY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Potential incidents that could occur on-site leading to harm or loss of assets, addressed in Clause 24."&lt;SEP&gt;"The indemnity clause covering damage to persons and property other than surface or crop damage on-site."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5236112da700e89f157c80fd002a7fb7</data>
