</node>
<node id="&quot;PATENT RIGHTS AND ROYALTIES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Legal aspects related to intellectual property, mentioned in Clause 30 of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"Patent rights and royalties pertain to intellectual property protections and financial benefits associated with inventions or innovations in the industry."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
