  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLEARANCE OF THE SITE ON COMPLETION&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clearance of the Site on completion is an event where all temporary structures, materials, and other items are removed after project completion."&lt;SEP&gt;"The process of finalizing a construction project by clearing the site as per Clause 37 of the document."&lt;SEP&gt;"This is an event where the Contractor must clear and clean the site after completing their contractual obligations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fef86c4247fdecc339b1414a3fdd5966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLICATION OF PHOTOGRAPHS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ACTIVITY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The act of publishing photographic records related to the construction work, discussed in Clause 38."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0c2575de447c966aae5e5a22feec1323</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;PUBLICATION OF PHOTOGRAPHS OF THE SITE OR THE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The event involves restrictions placed upon the Contractor regarding publishing photos related to the project without Employer's permission."&lt;SEP&gt;"The publication of photographs involves documenting the site or works for various purposes such as records, marketing, or compliance with agreements."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fef86c4247fdecc339b1414a3fdd5966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
