</node>
<node id="&quot;ENGAGEMENT OF LABOUR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Engagement of labour refers to hiring and managing workforce on a construction project."&lt;SEP&gt;"This event pertains to the Contractor’s responsibility in engaging labor for project execution and ensuring fair wages according to local practices."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fef86c4247fdecc339b1414a3fdd5966&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;FAIR WAGES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Fair wages are related to labor laws and practices ensuring workers receive appropriate compensation for their work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 1}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUALITY OF MATERIALS AND WORKMANSHIP AND TESTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The quality of materials and workmanship involves the standards and testing procedures used in construction projects to ensure durability and safety."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 23}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ACCESS TO THE SITE AND PLACES OF MANUFACTURE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Access refers to permissions granted for entry into specific areas, including manufacturing sites, necessary for material supply or inspection purposes."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 23}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;UNCOVERING AND MAKING OPENINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Uncovering and making openings are actions taken during construction where parts of the structure need to be exposed for work or inspections."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;RATE OF PROGRESS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Rate of Progress refers to the speed at which work is being completed, monitored by the Maintenance Surveyor and can lead to instructions for expedited progress if deemed too slow."&lt;SEP&gt;"The rate of progress measures how quickly a project is advancing, often used in performance evaluations and contract compliance checks."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-671cf14fabde451a853f4cb49e6a812f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 11}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIQUIDATED DAMAGES FOR DELAY&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Liquidated Damages for Delay is an event where penalties are imposed on the Contractor for failing to complete a Works Order within the prescribed time, leading to financial consequences."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquidated damages are pre-determined financial penalties imposed when work does not meet the agreed-upon timeline."&lt;SEP&gt;"Liquidated damages for delay refers to a predetermined amount that must be paid by the Contractor if they fail to complete a Works Order within the prescribed time frame."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-671cf14fabde451a853f4cb49e6a812f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87f722c8522f822c2e90eb078db141b6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 34}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUSPENSION OF THE WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Suspension refers to a temporary halt in construction activities, often due to unforeseen circumstances or contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE AND DEFECTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maintenance and defects cover ongoing care for structures as well as identifying and addressing issues that arise during use or operation."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;EXECUTION OF WORK OF REPAIR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The execution of work of repair involves carrying out necessary maintenance tasks to fix any damages or deficiencies in the construction project."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 24}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VESTING OF CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT AND TEMPORARY BUILDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Vesting refers to transferring ownership or control over equipment, structures, and materials used on a site from one party to another."</data>
  <data key="d2">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 0}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 24}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOMINATED SUBCONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nominated subcontractors are selected by the employer for specific tasks within the project scope."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-9df361e92365fbde2d17501741344b9a</data>
