  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 60}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LIABILITY FOR LOSS OR DAMAGE TO CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT 28&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This social science/industry term refers to the legal responsibilities of parties involved in the contract concerning potential losses or damages to construction equipment, highlighting risk management and insurance considerations."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d04fd928cd5cdad2902f95e470d14ad3</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;INCORPORATION OF CERTAIN CLAUSES IN SUB-CONTRACTS 28&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event involves integrating specific clauses into sub-contracts, ensuring that all parties involved have clear obligations and rights as defined by the main contract terms."</data>
