<node id="&quot;VARIATION ORDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"A Variation Order is an action taken under Clause 63(2) that changes the scope of work or terms of the contract, potentially affecting both parties involved in the Nominated Sub-contract."&lt;SEP&gt;"A Variation Order, issued in writing and signed by the Maintenance Surveyor, authorizes changes to work or materials detailed in a Works Order."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-62865738eafa658463c1c26212a98b20&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c0a211cf707d60ea80e6c68ae9e2599</data>
