</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIFICATION OR SCHEDULE OF RATES&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Specification or Schedule of Rates are documents detailing the rates for standard materials and works, which may be varied according to specific clauses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d72604c877ec1b265cace0cc38e4690d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 67}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;VARIATIONS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Variations refer to changes in work form, character, quality, or any different work/material not detailed in the Specification or Schedule of Rates that require agreement on new rates between parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d72604c877ec1b265cace0cc38e4690d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 66}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 79}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DAYWORK BASIS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Daywork Basis is a method for paying for work executed as per specific orders where payment is made based on time worked rather than pre-agreed rates."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d72604c877ec1b265cace0cc38e4690d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 67}]</data>
