<node id="&quot;NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTOR(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nominated Sub-contractors are organizations that provide work, materials, or services in connection with the works. They have obligations to the Contractor which can be assigned to the Employer after the maintenance period if they extend beyond it."&lt;SEP&gt;"Nominated Sub-contractors are selected by the Employer to execute specific works or supply goods, subject to terms provided in standard forms unless otherwise specified by the Maintenance Surveyor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fff7b29e752b0e4f9e3121c55ee790b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b0c5dc907f05ceb93ea74513adac240</data>
