</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE SURVEYOR (CLAUSE 69)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Maintenance Surveyor has the authority to instruct different terms for sub-contracts when necessary, overriding standard forms if required by specific project needs or circumstances."&lt;SEP&gt;"When instructed, the Maintenance Surveyor may direct the Contractor to enter into sub-contracts with different terms from those in the standard form provided by the Employer."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-0b0c5dc907f05ceb93ea74513adac240</data>
