  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Contractor must adhere to both contractual and sub-contractual obligations, ensuring consistency in their performance with the Employer’s directives and maintaining detailed records of claims and work execution."</data>
