  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 61}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;QUOTATIONS, INVOICES, VOUCHERS AND RECEIPTS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are documents that provide financial details related to expenditures in respect of Nominated Sub-contractors, required by the Maintenance Surveyor as per Clause 70(1)."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-3c0a211cf707d60ea80e6c68ae9e2599</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 29}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 67}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOMINATED SUB-CONTRACTORS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION/PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Nominated Sub-contractors are organizations or individuals contracted by the Contractor to perform specific tasks or supply goods/services."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1373b3be58ae445e60a533999b71823</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE SURVEYOR CERTIFICATE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT/TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Maintenance Surveyor certificate is a document that certifies payments due for work executed or materials/supplies provided by Nominated Sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1373b3be58ae445e60a533999b71823</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 31}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CLUES 79, 80, AND 81&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT/INDUSTRY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These are specific clauses in the contract that detail procedures related to issuing certificates regarding payments to Nominated Sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f1373b3be58ae445e60a533999b71823</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT AND TEMPORARY BUILDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Constructional plant and temporary buildings owned by the Contractor become property of the Employer upon being brought onto the site but can be removed by the Contractor at any time unless prohibited in writing by the Maintenance Surveyor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fff7b29e752b0e4f9e3121c55ee790b8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 64}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MATERIALS FOR INCORPORATION IN WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Materials owned by the Contractor that are to be incorporated into the works vest in the Employer once delivered to the site and cannot be removed without prior written consent from the Maintenance Surveyor, except as surplus upon completion of the works."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-fff7b29e752b0e4f9e3121c55ee790b8</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 64}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TEMPORARY BUILDINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Temporary Buildings are structures erected on-site that can be removed after completion of work, also owned by the Contractor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Temporary Buildings are structures used during construction that may become the property of the Employer if not completed by the Contractor within specified terms."&lt;SEP&gt;"Temporary buildings are structures erected on-site for short-term use, which must be removed after completion of works unless specifically allowed to remain or complete outstanding work."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d288eda39d01e6178bcf7c5f4500b57f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fb73081d4183e7d829a503c9bb63a946&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f3df24d7cf0a0114d43ffbcf5d5c71fd</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 59}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SURPLUS MATERIALS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"MATERIAL"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Surplus materials are those not required upon or prior to the completion of works and may revert in ownership back to the Contractor if found surplus but can also be sold by the Employer with proceeds going towards the Contractor after deducting charges and expenses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d288eda39d01e6178bcf7c5f4500b57f</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 66}, {"level": 3, "cluster": 79}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;HIRE OR HIRE-PURCHASE AGREEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"These refer to financial arrangements for acquiring constructional plant through leasing or purchase with periodic payments, managed under specific contract terms."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b3528cf552045555b1e6ac732dd25a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 19}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 61}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;LOSS OF OR DAMAGE TO CONSTRUCTIONAL PLANT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"This event pertains to the potential loss or damage of equipment that has become property of the Employer and is covered by specific clauses ensuring no liability for such losses unless stated otherwise in Clause 23."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b3528cf552045555b1e6ac732dd25a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SUBMISSIONS* FOR PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PROCESS"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The process involves submitting signed copies of payment requests after completion of measurement on each Works Order, subject to checking and correction by the Maintenance Surveyor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-1b3528cf552045555b1e6ac732dd25a0</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 3}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;DIMENSION BOOK(S)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Dimension Books are documents prepared by the Contractor and checked by the Maintenance Surveyor that detail the dimensions of work executed under a Works Order."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dimension Books are technical documentation supplied by the Contractor to detail completed work, which must be accompanied by necessary vouchers or receipts."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dimension books are documents that must be submitted for full and final measurement of work executed under a Works Order."&lt;SEP&gt;"Dimension books are technical documents that detail measurements and specifications for construction projects, used in verifying claims and correcting values."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8130c8086938f6df2d05cdf9fb7e405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77cf568578b8488d566bb45f92f61c0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f144b21e5d9d4c86fe6de033c3b52697&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-12ff1f20b792fbc8d1bdd961c49e1244</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CERTIFICATES FOR PAYMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Certificates for Payment are formal documents issued by the Maintenance Surveyor certifying the correct value of completed works, which then go to the Employer for payment."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-12ff1f20b792fbc8d1bdd961c49e1244</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 34}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;APPENDIX TO THE FORM OF TENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Appendix contains a standard base charge and an amount threshold used in determining how detailed measurements need to be provided with Complaint Chits."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Appendix contains specific details, such as payment schedules and conditions, related to Works Orders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f144b21e5d9d4c86fe6de033c3b52697&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77cf568578b8488d566bb45f92f61c0d</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 35}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;WORKS ORDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PRODUCT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Works Orders are documents that detail specific tasks or projects for which payments may be made, often related to construction or maintenance work."&lt;SEP&gt;"Works Orders are specific instructions or tasks issued under a contract that detail particular work requirements for the Contractor."&lt;SEP&gt;"Works Orders refer to specific orders or instructions issued by the Employer for work to be carried out, which are part of the overall contract between parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-8130c8086938f6df2d05cdf9fb7e405c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5861f6b1612f2edfb0a3b893d8508a12&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5e827172d85d4fce202f234f783e044</data>
