<node id="&quot;FORM OF TENDER&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Form of Tender is a document that includes an Appendix with details about interim payments and other relevant information for bidders."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f144b21e5d9d4c86fe6de033c3b52697</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 34}]</data>
</node>
