  <data key="d0">"LEGAL DOCUMENT CLAUSE"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clause 48 is a specific part of the Contract, likely dealing with conditions under which work may be condemned or terminated."&lt;SEP&gt;"Clause 48 pertains to orders from the Maintenance Surveyor that must be complied with by the Contractor, failure to do so may result in expulsion or other penalties."</data>
