<node id="&quot;WORKMEN&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Workmen refer to individuals employed by the Employer or other contractors who may be required to carry out work if the Contractor fails to do so within a reasonable time."&lt;SEP&gt;"Workmen refer to laborers employed directly by the Employer, distinct from those contracted through other means and involved in completing works as per contractual agreements."</data>
