  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 64}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;MAINTENANCE PERIODS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"SOCIAL SCIENCES"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Maintenance Periods are defined durations during which specific works completed by contractors under separate contracts must be maintained before final certification or payment can occur."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5861f6b1612f2edfb0a3b893d8508a12</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 2}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 28}, {"level": 2, "cluster": 64}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;SPECIAL RISKS&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Special Risks are unforeseen events that can lead to termination of the contract and affect payment terms as outlined in Clause 48."&lt;SEP&gt;"Special Risks refer to specific hazards that may cause destruction or damage to works or materials on site, entitling the Contractor to payment for such losses."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-d02dce26d755dbc2a1f010f8cd0550db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5fa9c6366e076e445101d83858797035</data>
