  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The dispute settlement mechanism involves the Maintenance Surveyor resolving conflicts between the Employer and Contractor through written decisions and continued work execution by the Contractor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5fa9c6366e076e445101d83858797035</data>
