  <data key="d2">chunk-5fa9c6366e076e445101d83858797035</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;CONTRACT TERMINATION/BREACH&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The contract can be terminated or abandoned due to various reasons including war or frustration of contract terms, affecting payment obligations between parties."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-5fa9c6366e076e445101d83858797035</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 14}]</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;ARBITRATOR&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
  <data key="d1">"An Arbitrator is mentioned in relation to disputes or differences, who will hear evidence from witnesses including the Maintenance Surveyor."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Arbitrator has the authority to open up, review, and revise decisions made by the Maintenance Surveyor (except for specific clauses), providing a final resolution in disputes between the Employer and Contractor."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-522c43aa0cb7d424d1da1c5b00c65777&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b46e3164fc93eef619ecf2b2643e1002</data>
