</node>
<node id="&quot;ARBITRATION ORDINANCE&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"TECHNOLOGY"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Arbitration Ordinance provides legal framework for arbitration proceedings in disputes between parties involved in a contract, including the rights of both the Contractor and Employer during such processes."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-522c43aa0cb7d424d1da1c5b00c65777</data>
  <data key="d3">[{"level": 0, "cluster": 4}, {"level": 1, "cluster": 34}]</data>
