</node>
<node id="&quot;CLAUSE 79 AND CLAUSE 81&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT, CONCEPT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"Clauses 79 and 81 are referenced as provisions for payment certification within the Contract, indicating key events in the contractual process."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3df24d7cf0a0114d43ffbcf5d5c71fd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;NOTICE PERIOD (14 DAYS)&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Notice Period of 14 days is an event where the Contractor gives a formal notice to the Employer regarding non-payment and potential contract termination."</data>
  <data key="d2">chunk-f3df24d7cf0a0114d43ffbcf5d5c71fd</data>
</node>
<node id="&quot;TERMINATION OF CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
  <data key="d1">"The Termination of Contract is an event that can occur if the Employer fails to make timely payments, leading to the end of contractual obligations between parties."</data>
