  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Night shifts are designated specifically for certain MEP installation activities such as those related to the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project, ensuring efficient work during non-peak hours."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MEP WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;NIGHT SHIFTS (22:00 TO 06:00)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Night shifts are specifically designated for executing certain MEP installation tasks to avoid daytime disruptions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1cb1c6b428ba5b83e35bfc82ae647386</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">14.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The EMPLOYER's payment to the MAIN CONTRACTOR affects the SUBCONTRACTOR's ability to receive payments due to the strict pay-when-paid condition."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Subcontractor also does not need to obtain prior consent from the Employer when sub-letting MEP installation works to third-party tier-2 sub-subcontractors."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-62cee928581076993e6dc7290419d468</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;BUILDING MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Building Management coordinates with the SUBCONTRACTOR to avoid daytime disruptions during structural works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;LUMP SUM SUBCONTRACT PRICE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The LUMP SUM SUBCONTRACT PRICE is the fixed amount agreed upon for the work performed by the SUBCONTRACTOR."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACTOR&quot;" target="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subcontractors like Nominated Sub-contractors are organizations or individuals working under Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited to execute parts of the works on the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project, subject to Maintenance Surveyor's authority for access and work inspections."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHILLER RIGGING&quot;" target="&quot;DUCTWORK INSTALLATION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both CHILLER RIGGING and DUCTWORK INSTALLATION are sub-contracted tasks that must be performed exclusively during Night Shifts (22:00 to 06:00) and on Sundays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CHILLER RIGGING&quot;" target="&quot;HIGH-VOLTAGE CABLE PULLING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both CHILLER RIGGING and HIGH-VOLTAGE CABLE PULLING are sub-contracted tasks that must be performed exclusively during Night Shifts (22:00 to 06:00) and on Sundays."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-6f34cc8c71a86a28ce1e2196a0e32a1a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;PERFORMANCE BOND&quot;" target="&quot;12-MONTH DLP UNDER CLAUSE 5.1&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Performance Bond is related to the 12-month Defects Liability Period (DLP), as it will be released immediately upon its expiry."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;24-MONTH PERIOD FROM PRACTICAL COMPLETION&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subcontract Works are related to this 24-month warranty period as it covers the rectification of defects during that timeframe."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;7-DAY TIME-BAR FOR NOTICE OF VARIATION CLAIM&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The 7-day time-bar is related to the submission of Notice of Variation Claim for Subcontract Works, ensuring timely claims are processed."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CONTRACT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Subcontracts are agreements entered into by Harbourfront Data Infrastructure Limited to execute specific portions of the works, incorporating clauses related to plant management and cost recovery for tasks like MEP installation on the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;ACCESS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"Access refers to the right granted to the Maintenance Surveyor and his authorized persons to enter various locations including the works on the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project, ensuring proper supervision and management of subcontractors like Nominated Sub-contractors."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SUBCONTRACT WORKS&quot;" target="&quot;SUB-CLAUSE (2)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Sub-clause 2 prohibits sub-letting without explicit written approval from the Maintenance Surveyor within a specified period, highlighting strict control measures over project execution on the Kowloon Bay Data Centre Project."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;LABOUR WAGES AND WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION&quot;" target="&quot;DIRECT LABOUR MANAGEMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Labor wages and workmen's compensation are directly managed by the Subcontractor, indicating a financial responsibility for workers' benefits."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;MAIN CONTRACTOR STATUTORY LIABILITY EXEMPTION UNDER SECTION 43C OF THE EMPLOYMENT ORDINANCE (CAP. 57)&quot;" target="&quot;EMPLOYEES' COMPENSATION ORDINANCE (CAP. 282) FOR WORK INJURIES SUSTAINED BY THE SUBCONTRACTOR'S WORKERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Main Contractor is exempt from statutory liabilities under the Employment Ordinance and Employees' Compensation Ordinance for work injuries sustained by Subcontractor's workers, indicating a clear contractual agreement."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-c69babc4008d2fc0d3e203e2eb49977b</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
