  <data key="d6">chunk-62cee928581076993e6dc7290419d468</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">15.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDER OPENING TEAM will open tenders under the guidance and authority of the TENDER BOARD."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tender Board oversees the Tender Opening Team which handles tender processes."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e28ad3fe56bbc0f196e83b01855316a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;NTT A2 PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDER OPENING TEAM follows NTT A2 Procedures for opening tenders."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e28ad3fe56bbc0f196e83b01855316a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;">
  <data key="d4">19.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDER OPENING TEAM will make copies of required documents for those who have failed to submit duplicates in electronic format."&lt;SEP&gt;"The TENDER OPENING TEAM will make copies of required documents on behalf of the tenderer if not submitted in duplicate electronic format."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tender Opening Team uses these boxes to collect and manage tender submissions."</data>
  <data key="d6">&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER SUBMISSION IN ELECTRONIC FORMAT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tender opening team assists with electronic submissions by making copies of required documents if duplicates are not provided in the correct format."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;OPENINGS TENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team performs the task during the event of openings tenders."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE BY FAX AND POST AT THE FAX NUMBER AND ADDRESS STATED IN THE REPLY SLIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team may communicate with the designated Engineer/Surveyor/Supervising Officer for clarification on tender documents."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team handles TENDER DOCUMENTS during their operations."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;CENTRAL TENDER BOARD / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CENTRAL TENDER BOARD / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD oversees and manages operations performed by the Tender Opening Team."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES AND THE TREASURY / CHAIRMAN OF THE PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The SECRETARY FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES AND THE TREASURY / CHAIRMAN OF THE PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD may provide guidance to the Tender Opening Team regarding charges for tender submissions."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;PLANS AND DRAWINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team handles PLANS AND DRAWINGS during their operations."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;SAMPLES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team handles SAMPLES during their operations."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER BOX&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team uses TENDER BOX to collect and manage tender submissions."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX LOCATION BLOCKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team may experience delays due to blockages at these locations."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER OPENING TEAM&quot;" target="&quot;TROPICAL CYCLONE SIGNAL NO. 8 OR ABOVE HOISTED / BLACK RAINSTORM WARNING SIGNAL ISSUED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Opening Team may experience delays due to weather-related events that extend submission periods."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;OPENING TENDERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDER BOARD sets the date and authorizes the opening of TENDERS through the TENDER OPENING TEAM."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-1e28ad3fe56bbc0f196e83b01855316a</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;NTT A2 PROCEDURES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NTT A2 Procedures provide guidance on how the Tender Opening Team should operate under the supervision of the Tender Board."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT OFFICER / COMPANY NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Board may interact with GOVERNMENT OFFICER / COMPANY NAME regarding oversight and management of the tender process."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NTT A3 PRE-TENDER MEETING&quot;" target="&quot;VENUE OF THE PRE-TENDER MEETING&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The venue of the pre-tender meeting is a key detail that needs to be specified for the tenderer."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NTT A3 PRE-TENDER MEETING&quot;" target="&quot;WBTC NO. 4/92&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"WBTC No. 4/92 is a reference number associated with the NTT A3 pre-tender meeting process."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;REPLY SLIP AT APPENDIX [INSERT APPROPRIATE REFERENCE] TO THESE NOTES TO TENDERERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tenderer must complete and submit the reply slip confirming attendance at the pre-tender meeting."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICIER DESIGNATE BY FAX AND POST AT THE FAX NUMBER AND ADDRESS STATED IN THE REPLY SLIP&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The tenderer must submit the reply slip to the designated officer by fax and post."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-cd345cf9a46f3f5c66ee8c178fe17aed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDERER can seek clarification from the ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE regarding any doubts about tender documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6f1c507a5f83ea7cc30c5ceefa06210</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;CLARIFICATIONS FROM ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDERER can obtain clarifications from the CLARIFICATIONS FROM ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE to understand tender documents better."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6f1c507a5f83ea7cc30c5ceefa06210</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;SAMPLES&quot;">
  <data key="d4">4.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Samples are to be submitted separately from the tender documents and not placed in the Government Secretariat Tender Box / Public Works Tender Box."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDERER must ensure that all required documents are properly signed, witnessed, and attached before sealing the tender for delivery to the Government Secretariat Tender Box or Public Works Tender Box."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER BOX&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Box is a place where tenderers deposit their bids."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;PRESS RELEASES ON THE WEBSITE OF INFORMATION SERVICES DEPARTMENT (HTTP://WWW.INFO.GOV.HK/GIA/GENERAL/TODAY.HTM)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Information Services Department's press releases can provide tenderers with important updates and announcements."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;NTT A8 REGULATING ACTIONS ON INAPPROPRIATE CONDUCTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NTT A8 policy on regulating actions involves the tenderer, specifically addressing their conduct and potential withdrawal of tenders or failure to implement accepted bids."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61c2f6f64e3310551b7f9deba4dfe97d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERER&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTOR MANAGEMENT HANDBOOK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Contractor Management Handbook provides guidelines on inappropriate conducts that could affect a tenderer's status, such as withdrawal of tenders and failure or refusal to implement accepted bids."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61c2f6f64e3310551b7f9deba4dfe97d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;WBTC NO. 4/92&quot;" target="&quot;INDUSTRIES INVOLVED&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The document is relevant to industries involved in construction."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE prepares the TENDER DOCUMENTS and provides clarifications for them."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6f1c507a5f83ea7cc30c5ceefa06210</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT OFFICER / COMPANY NAME&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The GOVERNMENT OFFICER / COMPANY NAME appoints the ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISEING OFFICER DESIGNATE to prepare and clarify tender documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6f1c507a5f83ea7cc30c5ceefa06210</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDER DOCUMENTS&quot;" target="&quot;CLARIFICATIONS FROM ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CLARIFICATIONS FROM ENGINEER/SURVEYOR/SUPERVISING OFFICER DESIGNATE provide explanations for any doubts about the TENDER DOCUMENTS."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6f1c507a5f83ea7cc30c5ceefa06210</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT OFFICER / COMPANY NAME&quot;" target="&quot;CONTACT TELEPHONE NUMBER&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The CONTACT TELEPHONE NUMBER is provided by the GOVERNMENT OFFICER / COMPANY NAME to facilitate communication regarding tender documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-e6f1c507a5f83ea7cc30c5ceefa06210</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER PRICE DOCUMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The TENDER PRICE DOCUMENTS are attached with or requested in the tender and need to be checked before sealing and delivery."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;" target="&quot;PLANS AND DRAWINGS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Plans and drawings should not be deposited with the tender but returned after submission, unless otherwise indicated."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;" target="&quot;CENTRAL TENDER BOARD / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Central Tender Board will make copies of Bills of Quantities and Schedule of Proportions for tenderers who have failed to submit such documents."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER BOX&quot;">
  <data key="d4">16.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Both are types of tender boxes used by the government for receiving tenders."&lt;SEP&gt;"The Tender Box is a specific location for submitting tenders, which can be either at Government Secretariat or Public Works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;" target="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS AFTER SUPER TYPHOONS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Announcements about extreme conditions after super typhoons will be made via press releases on the website of Information Services Department, which is related to the government's operations."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT TENDER BOX / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX&quot;" target="&quot;PRESS RELEASES ON THE WEBSITE OF INFORMATION SERVICES DEPARTMENT (HTTP://WWW.INFO.GOV.HK/GIA/GENERAL/TODAY.HTM)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Press releases on the website of Information Services Department are a means to announce important information, including those related to tender boxes."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CENTRAL TENDER BOARD / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;SECRETARY FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES AND THE TREASURY / CHAIRMAN OF THE PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Central Tender Board will make copies of Bills of Quantities and Schedule of Proportions on behalf of tenderers, with charges levied by the Chairman."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-d53f0499b320835ae79f654161939981</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CENTRAL TENDER BOARD / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX LOCATION BLOCKAGE&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Central Tender Board or Public Works Tender Board staff are instructed not to accept tenders delivered after the closing time, and they also manage blockages at their location."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;SECRETARY FOR FINANCIAL SERVICES AND THE TREASURY / CHAIRMAN OF THE PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOARD&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER SUBMISSION IN ELECTRONIC FORMAT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Secretary for Financial Services and the Treasury or Chairman of the Public Works Tender Board periodically advises on charges for duplicate electronic submissions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TROPICAL CYCLONE SIGNAL NO. 8 OR ABOVE HOISTED / BLACK RAINSTORM WARNING SIGNAL ISSUED&quot;" target="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS AFTER SUPER TYPHOONS ANNOUNCED BY GOVERNMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"These weather signals can extend the tender closing time if in effect during specific hours on the closing date."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;INFORMATION SERVICES WEBSITE / PRESS RELEASES&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT SECRETARIAT / PUBLIC WORKS TENDER BOX LOCATION BLOCKAGE EXTENSION ANNOUNCEMENTS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Information Services website and press releases are used to announce extensions due to blockages or extreme weather conditions."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-054cdae45c09cbe20c735d8967a84935</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;EXTREME CONDITIONS AFTER SUPER TYPHOONS&quot;" target="&quot;PRESS RELEASES ON THE WEBSITE OF INFORMATION SERVICES DEPARTMENT (HTTP://WWW.INFO.GOV.HK/GIA/GENERAL/TODAY.HTM)&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Press releases on the website of Information Services Department are used to announce information about extreme conditions after super typhoons."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-a6502b9ed785b83b9a40ac91777278ed</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NTT A7 CHANGES IN STATUS OF QUALIFICATIONS&quot;" target="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The document 'NTT A7 Changes in status of qualifications' outlines guidelines for Tenderers to inform the Government about factors affecting their qualification status."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b4144bf8068bf5c4282e2d5caa7067c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;TENDERERS&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Government has the right to review tenderers' qualified status based on new information provided by them or other relevant data. This relationship is established through the document's guidelines."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b4144bf8068bf5c4282e2d5caa7067c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;SPR 330&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"SPR 330 provides advice for Tenderers to inform the Government of factors that might affect their qualified status, indicating a connection between SPR 330 and the Government through this document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b4144bf8068bf5c4282e2d5caa7067c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;THE CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Compliance verification involves ensuring adherence to Government rules and regulations as required for the Works."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-949aa5f14dfe77c1d4658936c3d545de</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">8.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Government may require contractors to observe certain regulations and conditions in their work."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f19199388ebb0416790d9140af888a4f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;GOVERNMENT&quot;" target="&quot;DEPARTMENT OF LABOUR AND HONG KONG&quot;">
  <data key="d4">9.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Department of Labour is responsible for enforcing labour regulations as mandated by the Government."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-f19199388ebb0416790d9140af888a4f</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;TENDERERS&quot;" target="&quot;SPR 330&quot;">
  <data key="d4">5.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"Tenderers are advised by SPR 330 to inform the Government of factors that might affect their qualified status, establishing a relationship between Tenderers and SPR 330 through this document."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-b4144bf8068bf5c4282e2d5caa7067c8</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NTT A8 REGULATING ACTIONS ON INAPPROPRIATE CONDUCTS&quot;" target="&quot;CONTRACTOR MANAGEMENT HANDBOOK&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NTT A8 policy references the Contractor Management Handbook for specific details on inappropriate conducts and actions to be taken against tenderers."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61c2f6f64e3310551b7f9deba4dfe97d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;NTT A8 REGULATING ACTIONS ON INAPPROPRIATE CONDUCTS&quot;" target="&quot;DEVB MEMO REF. DEVB(W) 546/70/02 DATED 10.2.2021&quot;">
  <data key="d4">6.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The NTT A8 policy advises tenderers based on the guidance provided in the DEVB memo, which pertains to regulating actions for withdrawal of tenders and failure or refusal to implement accepted bids within the Tender Validity Period."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61c2f6f64e3310551b7f9deba4dfe97d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;CONTRACTOR MANAGEMENT HANDBOOK&quot;" target="&quot;MAINTENANCE SURVEYOR&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.5</data>
  <data key="d5">"The document outlines rules for managing contractors, including descriptions of inappropriate conduct and regulations for tenderers. The Maintenance Surveyor is a key figure in this process."</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
<edge source="&quot;DEVB MEMO REF. DEVB(W) 546/70/02 DATED 10.2.2021&quot;" target="&quot;TENDER VALIDITY PERIOD&quot;">
  <data key="d4">7.0</data>
  <data key="d5">"The Tender Validity Period is a key factor in the advice provided by the DEVB memo, which deals with actions to be taken within this period if a tenderer withdraws or fails to implement an accepted bid."</data>
  <data key="d6">chunk-61c2f6f64e3310551b7f9deba4dfe97d</data>
  <data key="d7">1</data>
</edge>
